{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36464","headline":"秋夕旅怀 · 罗邺","name":"秋夕旅怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阶前月色与蛩声，阶上愁人坐复行。\n秦谷入霜空有梦，越山无计可归耕。\n穷途若遣长堪恸，华髪无因肯晚生。\n不似扁舟钓鱼者，免将心事筭浮荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36464.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36464","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}